1
00:00:00,802 --> 00:00:02,262
Awesome. Mine says:

2
00:00:02,428 --> 00:00:07,768
"To my friend Howard.
From Stan Lee. Excelsior!"

3
00:00:08,184 --> 00:00:12,314
Mine says, "To Raj. From Stan Lee."

4
00:00:15,942 --> 00:00:19,362
That's because you pissed him off
about his character names.

5
00:00:19,529 --> 00:00:21,319
(Raj:)I didn't even mention
Dum Dum Dugan...

6
00:00:21,489 --> 00:00:25,199
(Raj:)...or Green Goblin, Matt Murdock,
Pepper Potts, Victor von Doom.

7
00:00:25,368 --> 00:00:29,498
(Raj:)Oh, and worst of all, Millie the Model.

8
00:00:30,748 --> 00:00:31,788
(Penny:)We're home.

9
00:00:31,958 --> 00:00:35,628
(Leonard:)-Oh, hey, buddy. How'd it go?
-You know very well how it went.

10
00:00:35,795 --> 00:00:38,635
Yeah. But we all wanna
hear it from you.

11
00:00:40,967 --> 00:00:45,967
(Sheldon:)-I was found guilty and fined $533.
-I'm gonna write you a check for that.

12
00:00:46,139 --> 00:00:50,179
(Penny:)As long as you promise to put it in your
drawer and never cash it like the others.

13
00:00:53,479 --> 00:00:58,019
(Sheldon:)I also now have three points on
a driver's license I do not yet possess...

